OL,3,ANvidia shares tumble over investigation
OL,4,Ainto Huang's affair with alleged
OL,5,AChinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, China has rejected the claims,
OL,8,Fwith its foreign ministry saying
OL,9,Fallegations about Chinese spies were
OL,10,F"entirely groundless, speculative and
OL,11,Fintended to smear and malign China".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
