OL,3,AUkraine peace talks resume with 'some
OL,4,Aflexibility' by warring sides, US
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FMoscow and Kyiv are privately showing
OL,8,F"a little bit of flexibility" on the
OL,9,Fissue of who would controls Ukraine's
OL,10,Feastern regions in a postwar scenario,
OL,11,FUS officials have said.
OL,13,FThe comments came on the eve of the
OL,14,Ffirst trilateral talks aimed at ending
OL,15,Fthe war in Ukraine since February.
OL,17,FSenior officials from Moscow, Kyiv and
OL,18,FWashington will meet in Abu Dhabi as
OL,19,Fthe fifth anniversary of Russia's
OL,20,Ffull-scale invasion of Ukraine
OL,21,Fapproaches.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
